                              "alignItems": "center",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "bvlqA",
                                  "name": "chip1",
                                  "context": "Prompt chip (default state). Pill-shaped suggestion button shown below the input field. Displays a pre-written financial question the user can tap to send. Font: Heebo 14, fill $g:sem-chatBg, border $g:sem-navBorder, radius $g:radius-md. States: default, hover, pressed.",
                                  "fill": "$g:sem-chatBg",
                                  "cornerRadius": "$g:radius-md",
                                  "stroke": "$g:sem-navBorder",
                                  "strokeWidth": 1,
                                  "strokeAlignment": "inner",
                                  "padding": [
                                    12,
                                    16
                                  ],
                                  "justifyContent": "center",
                                  "alignItems": "center",
